capabilities:
  - title: 24x7 monitoring and alerting
    description: Health, connection pools, slow queries, replication lag. Alerts tuned to real signals. On-call staffed with engineers, not escalation desks.
  - title: Patching and upgrades
    description: Minor versions on schedule. Major versions planned, rehearsed, and cut over with a rollback. No surprise database restarts.
  - title: Backup and restore
    description: Backups tested with scheduled restore drills. Point-in-time recovery verified, not assumed. Cross-region copies where the workload warrants.
  - title: Performance tuning
    description: Index review, query optimization, connection pooling, vacuum and autovacuum tuning. Quarterly performance report with a ranked backlog.
  - title: Replication and HA
    description: Primary and replica topology designed for your workload. Failover tested. Promotion drills on a calendar, not on incident night.
  - title: Security and access
    description: User and role audits, credential rotation, TLS enforcement, and the audit logs your compliance team expects.
